@SengokuScroll.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100

### 加载剧本 mini_kanto
POST {{SengokuScroll.WebApi_HostAddress}}/strategy/load
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioId": "mini_kanto"
}

### 获取世界状态
GET {{SengokuScroll.WebApi_HostAddress}}/strategy/state

### 织田先锋 (id=1) 移动到 (5,4)
POST {{SengokuScroll.WebApi_HostAddress}}/strategy/units/1/move
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 5,
  "y": 4
}

### 推进 1 天
POST {{SengokuScroll.WebApi_HostAddress}}/strategy/advance-day
